From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kuraka <kuraka@localhost>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:20:44 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(inboxes): Messenger and Instagram channels
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Kuraka-Severity: normal
Kuraka-Adds-En: Messenger and Instagram inboxes receive and answer the messages sent to a Facebook Page or to the Instagram professional account linked to it. Instagram replies are text only.
Kuraka-Adds-Es: Los buzones de Messenger e Instagram reciben y responden los mensajes enviados a una página de Facebook o a la cuenta profesional de Instagram vinculada a ella. Las respuestas de Instagram son solo texto.
Kuraka-Missing-En: Libredesk has no Messenger or Instagram channel.
Kuraka-Missing-Es: Libredesk no tiene canal de Messenger ni de Instagram.
